      "match": false
    }
  ],
  "patternRefs": [
    "DPK-PAT-2802"
  ],
  "remediation": "Use the HTTPS endpoint the registry publishes and keep the hostname in the configuration reviewable. Specifically: fix a `<distributionManagement><repository>` URL over cleartext.",
  "limitation": "It matches a `<distributionManagement><repository>` URL over cleartext in the parsed pom.xml; it cannot tell whether the package is installed, whether any published version is affected by an advisory, or whether the dependency reaches production code."
}
